listing:   f406_main.cc boottrace; trace_csv.py
toolchain: QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18); Python 3.13.16
command:   qemu-system-x86_64 -machine q35 -m 64M -nodefaults -display none -no-reboot -monitor none -device isa-debug-exit,iobase=0xf4,iosize=0x04 -serial stdio -kernel k406.elf -append boottrace [slowahci] -drive file=sata.img,if=none,id=sd0,format=raw -device ide-hd,drive=sd0,bus=ide.0 -drive file=vblk.img,if=none,id=vd0,format=raw -device virtio-blk-pci,drive=vd0,disable-legacy=on; python3 -I trace_csv.py healthy.txt slow.txt boottrace.csv
date:      2026-10-09T21:42:48Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 0
note:      exit code 0 = both boots exited with 33 and the CSV was written
hardware:  untested on hardware; QEMU 8.2.2 with TCG (no KVM in the build container)
